# Edit Patterns

Quick reference for which files to modify for common tasks.

## Feature Changes

| Task | Files to modify |
|------|-----------------|
| New transformation type | `types/config.go` (add const) → `services/workflow_processor.go` (implement) |
| New pattern type | `types/config.go` (add const) → `services/pattern_matcher.go` (implement) |
| New config field | `types/config.go` (add to struct) → consumers in `services/` |
| Webhook logic | `services/webhook_handler_new.go` |
| Rate limit behavior | `services/rate_limit.go` |
| Auth flow | `services/github_auth.go` + `services/token_manager.go` |
| Health/metrics endpoints | `services/health_metrics.go` |
| Slack notifications | `services/slack_notifier.go` |

## CLI Tools

| Tool | Location |
|------|----------|
| config-validator | `cmd/config-validator/main.go` |
| test-webhook | `cmd/test-webhook/main.go` |
| test-pem | `cmd/test-pem/main.go` |

## Key Entry Points

- **App startup**: `app.go`
- **Webhook orchestration**: `services/webhook_handler_new.go` → `HandleWebhookWithContainer()`
- **Core file matching**: `services/workflow_processor.go` → `ProcessWorkflow()`
- **DI container**: `services/service_container.go`

## After Making Changes

1. Run tests: `go test -race ./services -v`
2. Run linter: `golangci-lint run ./...`
3. Update `CHANGELOG.md` under `[Unreleased]`
4. Update docs if user-facing (see `docs/`)
